  "title": "· In Focus | Louis Vuitton × Singer Unveils Custom Porsche 911: A Tribute to the Art of Travel ·",
  "original_title": "视野 | Louis Vuitton × Singer 合作推出 Porsche 911 定制座驾：致敬旅行艺术",
  "excerpt": "Louis Vuitton and Singer Vehicle Design craft bespoke Porsche 911s, blending luxury craftsmanship with high-performance automotive art.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-09-02",
