      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton has teamed up with California-based Singer Vehicle Design to create two bespoke Porsche 911s, marrying LV’s leather craftsmanship and watchmaking savoir-faire with the iconic sports car’s DNA. The result pushes both mechanical performance and travel aesthetics to the extreme, turning the open road into a rolling gallery of art.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This marks Louis Vuitton’s first foray into automotive design, extending the maison’s Art of Travel philosophy. Conceived over the course of a full year by both teams, the collaboration yields two distinct, one-of-a-kind collector’s cars: the Porsche 911 Reimagined by Singer – Classic coupé, inspired by LV’s signature packaging palette with saffron and cobalt tones for a vintage travel vibe, and the Porsche 911 Reimagined by Singer – Classic Turbo cabriolet, envisioned by LV’s women’s artistic director Nicolas Ghesquière, finished in ivory white with wood interior accents that nod to the nautical elegance of classic motorboats.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
