    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Porsche 911 Classic coupé has been reimagined by Singer according to Louis Vuitton’s vision, finished in LV’s most iconic saffron paint, with cobalt blue accents on the tires and interior details inspired by the handles and ribbons of LV packaging. The saddle stitching on seats, doors, leather goods, and trunks is echoed in bright yellow thread, tying the whole design together.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
