    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The cabin is fully upholstered in leather whose natural hue resembles the VVT leather often used by LV. Diamond patterns adorn the seats, front trunk trim, and rear engine bay, referencing the Malletage quilting found inside LV hard-sided trunks. Seat ventilation perforations, sun visors, and headrests feature the classic Monogram flower motif, while adjustment knobs, control switches, latches, pull rings, and vents are crafted from metal and hand-finished. A roof rack can flexibly accommodate travel cases, surfboards, skis, and other gear.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
