      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Porsche 911 Classic Turbo cabriolet, envisioned by Nicolas Ghesquière, artfully merges nautical and automotive aesthetics. The open-top design lets drivers feel the sun and the sensorial thrill of the ride more directly. Its ivory white paint is inspired by the limestone that shapes Paris’s cityscape, while leather and wood interior details pay homage to the elegance of classic motorboats, complemented by gold accents that adorn the body like jewelry.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
