    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "All functional elements inside are crafted from metal. A custom dashboard clock takes center stage on the console, its warm gold face echoing the gold ignition key. The gearshift’s drawstring leather trim is inspired by the silhouette of the classic Noé handbag. Seats feature wooden shells upholstered in leather, and the rear luggage compartment is made of lacquered wood to house the lightweight soft top. The engine bay and front trunk are also lined with wood veneer, while leather straps on the front and rear lids draw from the traditions of trunk-making and watch straps.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
