      "text": "Specs at a glance · Type 964 cabriolet chassis · Lutetian limestone white carbon-fiber body with whale-tail rear wing · 3.8L twin-turbocharged flat-six engine with air-to-water intercooler · Six-speed manual gearbox with selectable drive modes · Rear-wheel drive · Carbon-ceramic braking system",
