    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton has also crafted a full range of travel companions for both cars, including custom luggage, racing jackets, helmets, gloves, and shoes. Every piece is designed to perfectly match the corresponding vehicle in terms of design language, color, and craftsmanship—one car, one collection—creating a complete bespoke travel ecosystem.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Classic limited collection primarily uses Cuir Millésime calf leather, similar to that found in the car’s interior. Luggage includes the Bisten hard case, Keepall travel bag, and a custom helmet case, with saffron and cobalt color-blocking that echoes the car’s palette, feeling like a natural extension of the cabin.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
